### 1. 上传并解析 EPUB 电子书文件
# @name parseBook
POST http://localhost:8000/api/books/parse-file
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="乡土中国.epub"
Content-Type: application/epub+zip

< ../resources/乡土中国.epub
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="project_id"

proj_default
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="book_id"

bk_xiangtu_01
--WebAppBoundary--

### 2. 获取书籍详细元数据
GET http://localhost:8000/api/books/bk_xiangtu_01
Accept: application/json

### 3. 获取书籍目录大纲树 (TOC)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/books/bk_xiangtu_01/toc
Accept: application/json

### 4. 获取指定章节切片内容 (懒加载)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/books/bk_xiangtu_01/chapters/chap_01?offset=0&limit=10
Accept: application/json

### 5. 触发沙箱完整性验证与自愈检查
POST http://localhost:8000/api/books/bk_xiangtu_01/verify
Accept: application/json
